    {
      "claim_id": "claim_588525d31ec109613755a8b6",
      "text": "As of early 2026, flex and rigid-flex PCBs imported from China face total effective tariffs of approximately 35% — comprising a 25% Section 301 tariff (no exemption currently applies to flex and non-FR4 PCBs) plus a 10% IEEPA global tariff.",
