      "chunk_id": "chunk_ec23520aa49864a008ca43ef"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "claim_6bd205aa45d27e648ae04f33",
      "text": "For mid-volume production, Chinese suppliers typically charge 5–5–15 per board versus 15–15–40 per board for U.S. domestic manufacturers.",
